{
  "$comment": "Default token contract for shadcn/ui (Tailwind v4 naming) plus status and readable-text tokens. Copy into the project as token-contract.json and edit it to match the project's real token names. Pairs with level 'error' fail validation; 'warn' pairs report known-risky combinations without failing. derived tokens are written by scripts/fix-contrast.mjs into a style's adjustments when the style does not define them. palettes list colors that must stay distinguishable from each other, with typical vision and simulated protanopia, deuteranopia and tritanopia (minDistance is a ΔEOK).",
